        "PMC7514873::web::007::3_1_precipitation_kinetics"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The precipitates induced in aged TiVNbTa will be fine, uniformly distributed, and coherent.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6478865::web::028::conclusions_and_summary",
        "PMC7514873::web::007::3_1_precipitation_kinetics"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Controlled cooling after aging will promote uniform precipitation without causing unwanted phase transformations in TiVNbTa.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nanoscale precipitates will impede dislocation motion and thereby precipitation-strengthen TiVNbTa.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6478865::web::028::conclusions_and_summary"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The precipitates will inhibit recovery and recrystallization at high temperature.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The aging treatment will raise the 1273 K yield strength of TiVNbTa above the approximately 330 MPa baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The aging treatment will delay heat-induced softening of TiVNbTa at 1273 K.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Aged TiVNbTa will retain sufficient or ample ductility for service at the W-to-CuCrZr interface.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The aged TiVNbTa intermediate layer will maintain efficient heat transfer between tungsten and CuCrZr.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Longer aging can increase precipitate size and reduce precipitate number density.",
